Attribution: the rules in this folder are from the SigmaHQ repository
(https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma), released under the Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 above.
Each rule keeps its own "author", "id" and "references" fields; the first comment
line of each file names its path in that repository. Kratos uses them only as test
fixtures (which fields Sigma rules reference); they are not shipped.
